PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/triggers/{script_name}
Adds event trigger declarations without removing existing declarations owned by the script.
Required: script_name (path); account_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/triggers/{script_name}
Deletes all event trigger declarations owned by a Worker script.
Required: script_name (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/triggers/{script_name}
Returns the event trigger declarations owned by a Worker script.
Required: script_name (path); account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/triggers/{script_name}
Replaces all event trigger declarations owned by a Worker script.
Required: script_name (path); account_id (path); body (body)
